# Live-test outputs — not source
packages/*/tests/live/last-run.json

# Generated code — style-gating it can only ever fail.
#
# These files are emitted by the per-package codegen (`src/generated/`, from the
# vendored OpenAPI specs) and by the registry snapshot generator, and the
# generators do not run their output through prettier. Committing them
# prettier-formatted therefore only holds until the next regeneration: the
# formatting is undone, and `format:check` fails on a diff no one authored.
#
# That is what happened on 2026-07-26 — #170 committed regenerated output and
# turned `main` red on `build-and-test`, which is a `format:check` step, for
# seven files nobody had hand-edited. Fixing it with `prettier --write` would
# have lasted exactly until the next `pnpm run build`.
#
# If you want these formatted, pipe the generators through prettier at emit
# time; do not re-add them here.
packages/*/src/generated/
packages/*/dist/
**/*.generated.ts
